#: src/orca/cmdnames.py:1207
msgctxt "mathcat"
msgid "Zoom out"
msgstr "يىراقلات"

#. Translators: Orca has a modal math navigation mode powered by MathCAT
#. (https://daisy.github.io/MathCAT). This command descends as deep as
